    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This software allows you to enjoy heartwarming and joyful stories and still illustrations set in the world of &quot;Mehterhane,&quot; which features 18 unique countries such as the Land of Sweets, the Land of Fairies, and the Land of Minorities. It is presented as an adventure game and illustration gallery.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story Mode<br>Enjoy over 80 stories as an adventure game. It will heal your heart with its touching tales!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425890/extras/3dbd5666ceae4055a832a16f5f6c4096.avif?t=1742354127\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gallery Mode<br>Enjoy the charming characters, monsters, and still illustrations that appear in the stories anytime with the gallery feature!</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425890/extras/dada0e4e191d4c67d8a6578f17518c67.avif?t=1742354127\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Synopsis</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where humans and monsters coexist.<br>There existed individuals known as &quot;Healers&quot; who used their powers to guide the often conflicting beings towards harmony.<br>The story begins with the clich\u00e9d awakening of the protagonist, and the girl acting as his alarm clock is surprisingly trapped in a bottle!<br>Embarking on a journey for the sake of his friend, the bottled girl &quot;Merc,&quot; what fate awaits this apprentice healer!?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Character Illustrations Full of Charm</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From boys and girls to men and women of all ages, and even demons and angels, various characters and monsters, depicted while preserving the world\u2019s essence, play significant roles in the story!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This software allows you to enjoy heartwarming and joyful stories and still illustrations set in the world of &quot;Mehterhane,&quot; which features 18 unique countries such as the Land of Sweets, the Land of Fairies, and the Land of Minorities. It is presented as an adventure game and illustration gallery.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story Mode<br>Enjoy over 80 stories as an adventure game. It will heal your heart with its touching tales!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425890/extras/3dbd5666ceae4055a832a16f5f6c4096.avif?t=1742354127\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gallery Mode<br>Enjoy the charming characters, monsters, and still illustrations that appear in the stories anytime with the gallery feature!</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425890/extras/dada0e4e191d4c67d8a6578f17518c67.avif?t=1742354127\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Synopsis</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where humans and monsters coexist.<br>There existed individuals known as &quot;Healers&quot; who used their powers to guide the often conflicting beings towards harmony.<br>The story begins with the clich\u00e9d awakening of the protagonist, and the girl acting as his alarm clock is surprisingly trapped in a bottle!<br>Embarking on a journey for the sake of his friend, the bottled girl &quot;Merc,&quot; what fate awaits this apprentice healer!?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Character Illustrations Full of Charm</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From boys and girls to men and women of all ages